Z||000000||Cameron||04-26-2001||03:41 PM||||Jeez! The computer industry has been sucking lately.  I was on a really good contract during the stock problems, and didn't leave the contract to get a full time job. That was a bad move.  And now there is nothing out there.  I've been looking for work in Cold Fusion, the internet language I develop websites in, in all states now and nothing.  Yeash, maybe I should just get a job a CompUSA, Best Buy, or some other joe job.  Anybody got any ideas of good paying crap jobs?  At this rate I'll never be able to move out of my parents house.  Which I admit is both bogus and sad.  But, ... I still know how to party.  * smacks head *  Seen Wayne's World a couple times too many, if that's possible.<P>Anyway, if anybody has any ideas I'd be grateful.<P>Thanks,<P>------------------<BR>Cameron<BR> <A HREF="http://Fiero.NetMARC.com" TARGET=_blank>http://Fiero.NetMARC.com</A> ||||reg||1
