Z||000003||Cameron||04-26-2001||08:12 PM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DISenchanted:<BR><B>I wish I could help, but I'm in the same boat.  I'm thinking CompUSA as well.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I worked at CompUSA for awhile...it really sucks they pay about 8 an hr + commission...really crappy pay.  I'm trying to move out and calculated I need about 15 an hour to make some money but not much, bout 600 a month.  And no 15 an hr isn't enough to live in california.  not anywhere nice anyway.<P>Ah, Lisa very helpful as usual   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> hehe j/k<P>Ya and if a frog had wings he wouldn't bump his a** when he hopped.<P>Scha right as if we wouldn't notice.<P>ok enough lines.<P>But I really want to get into horses, but horse people don't have any money.  And training is a hobby not a living.<P>And I'm not all that hot of a mechanic so working on cars is out.  I'm just SCREWED!<P>Oh well, enough pissing and moaning.<P>Maybe I should just join the Air Force and get it over with.  That's a pretty bad idea, but atleast its money.<P>------------------<BR>Cameron<BR> <A HREF="http://Fiero.NetMARC.com" TARGET=_blank>http://Fiero.NetMARC.com</A> <P>[This message has been edited by Cameron (edited 04-26-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Cameron (edited 04-26-2001).]||||reg||1
