Z||000010||p4n1c||04-27-2001||11:56 AM||||I work for AT&T here in Canada, right now I'm in the network order department, I'm hoping to move over to IES(the internet side) after maybe 2 years here(I can move after 18 months).  <P>You just have to get your foot in the door for a company that has an IT or IS department and allows you to move(even if you start out with a job that has nothing to do with what you want).  I want to get into either Network Administration or Network Security here or at another company(It looks good to have AT&T Canada plastered on your resume   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> plus experience helps   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ).<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)<p>[This message has been edited by p4n1c (edited 04-27-2001).]||||reg||1
